        <p source="#source-7386-7856"><seg source="#source-7386-7389">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7389-7416"><rb>留守中</rb><rt>るゐちう</rt></ruby><note type="sic" source="#source-7416-7461" target="#source-7401-7413">ルビの「るゐちう」はママ</note><seg source="#source-7461-7470">これは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7470-7494"><rb>失禮</rb><rt>しつれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7494-7506">でした。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7506-7521"><rb>妻</rb><rt>さい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7521-7524">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7524-7536"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7536-7554">ませんので、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7554-7578"><rb>女中</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-7578-7647"><lem>ぢよちう</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-7629-7641">ぢうちう</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7647-7680">ばかり‥‥や、つまらん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7680-7695"><rb>物</rb><rt>もの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7695-7698">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7698-7719"><rb>差上</rb><rt>さしあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7719-7725">げて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7725-7755"><rb>恐縮</rb><rt>きようしゆく</rt></ruby>しました』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7773-7809"><rb>花竦薑</rb><rt>はならつきやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7809-7812">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7812-7833"><rb>下目</rb><rt>しため</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7833-7836">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7836-7848"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7848-7856">る。</seg></p>
