        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-8544-9389"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8547-8574"><rb>原田氏</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-8574-8634"><lem>はらだし</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-8616-8628">　らだし</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8634-8637">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8637-8670"><rb>星亨氏</rb><rt>ほしとほるし</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8670-8691"><rb>幕下</rb><rt>ばつか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8691-8694">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8694-8721"><rb>雄將</rb><rt>ゆうしやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8721-8727">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8727-8754"><rb>關東</rb><rt>くわんとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8754-8757">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8757-8769"><rb>於</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8769-8775">ける</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8775-8796"><rb>壯士</rb><rt>さうし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8796-8799">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8799-8832"><rb>大親分</rb><rt>おほおやぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8832-8844">である。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8844-8868"><rb>嶺村</rb><rt>みねむら</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8868-8892"><rb>草分</rb><rt>くさわけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8892-8895">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8895-8916"><rb>舊家</rb><rt>きうけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8916-8931">であるが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8931-8961"><rb>政事熱</rb><rt>せいじねつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8961-8964">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8964-8985"><rb>大分</rb><rt>だいぶ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8985-9000"><rb>軒</rb><rt>のき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9000-9003">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" ren