        <p source="#source-9389-9733">『やア、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9401-9416"><rb>僕</rb><rt>ぼく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9416-9419">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9419-9434"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9434-9461">、フアーマーをして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9461-9473"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9473-9476">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9476-9494"><rb>處</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9494-9506">だ。まア</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9506-9521"><rb>上</rb><rt>あが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9521-9524">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9524-9539"><rb>給</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9539-9545">へ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9545-9557"><rb>直</rb><rt>ぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9557-9560">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9560-9575"><rb>足</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9575-9578">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9578-9593"><rb>洗</rb><rt>あら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9593-9599">ふ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9599-9632"><rb>離座敷</rb><rt>はなれざしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9632-9635">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9635-9656"><rb>見晴</rb><rt>みはら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9656-9662">しが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9662-9674"><rb>好</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>いから』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9689-9707"><rb>客</rb><rt>きやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9707-9710">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9710-9725"><rb>好</rb><rt>この</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9725-9733">む。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-9733-9960">『いや、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9745-9760"><rb>上</rb><rt>あが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9760-9769">らんで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9769-9793"><rb>其儘</rb><rt>そのまゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9793-9796">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9796-9808"><rb>好</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9808-9814">い。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9814-9826"><rb>掘</rb><rt>ほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9826-9832">りに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9832-9844"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9844-9880">くのだから、フアーマーが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9880-9904"><rb>結構</rb><rt>けつかう</rt></ruby>だ』と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9913-9946"><rb>東皐氏</rb><rt>とうくわうし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9946-9960">はいふ。</seg></p>
